    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mang\u00fat</strong> is a <strong>single-player platform adventure</strong> without combat, featuring a <strong>narrative</strong> that unveils the daily life of <strong>app delivery workers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you play as Gil, a grumpy and persistent hedgehog struggling financially. In the delivery app, he finds a way to earn money to support his family, embarking on a journey filled with sweat, challenges, and unexpected twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing across the platforms</strong> with a mechanical arm, dare to make tough decisions, and <strong>lead a revolution in Morro do Mang\u00fat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/b0594dc18c3a010c6b06236a8ab16164.poster.avif?t=1755119086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/b0594dc18c3a010c6b06236a8ab16164.webm?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/b0594dc18c3a010c6b06236a8ab16164.mp4?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Narrative</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presents the dilemmas and challenges faced by a favela's worker;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explores themes such as entrepreneurship, meritocracy, and revolution;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features diverse and deep characters with contrasting worldviews;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Caramel&quot; mutt.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/5d87b42c75570e198ba81046b1d8ec56.poster.avif?t=1755119086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/5d87b42c75570e198ba81046b1d8ec56.webm?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/5d87b42c75570e198ba81046b1d8ec56.mp4?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Speed Precision Platformer</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, dash, and swing through the scenario with boldness and fun;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete deliveries as quickly as possible without damaging the cargo to satisfy your customers and optimize your earnings;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 20 levels with dozens of challenges, platforms, and secret areas for you to explore and showcase your skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/f63d10c06d6c9e39f97f78edf0e7bbc5.poster.avif?t=1755119086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/f63d10c06d6c9e39f97f78edf0e7bbc5.webm?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/f63d10c06d6c9e39f97f78edf0e7bbc5.mp4?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision-Making</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices in dialogues impact Gil's relationships with other characters and can affect gameplay;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter characters during levels: they may offer interesting side quests;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the money you earn strategically to pay the bills at the end of each day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/ed5e6c39fcd8e449cb8f01970320a0f6.poster.avif?t=1755119086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/ed5e6c39fcd8e449cb8f01970320a0f6.webm?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/ed5e6c39fcd8e449cb8f01970320a0f6.mp4?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Retrofuturistic Brazil</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gil has a mechanical arm prosthesis powered by energy, which can stretch and interact creatively with the environmental elements;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features characters, settings, and a soundtrack that are typically Brazilian, reimagined with steampunk and cyberpunk elements;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 unique scenarios: the favela Morro do Mang\u00fat, a forest in the city's upscale area, an open TV studio, and a drone factory with precarious working conditions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/b3d766e60fc2e457f821290cfab72485.poster.avif?t=1755119086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/b3d766e60fc2e457f821290cfab72485.webm?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/b3d766e60fc2e457f821290cfab72485.mp4?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mang\u00fat</strong> is a <strong>single-player platform adventure</strong> without combat, featuring a <strong>narrative</strong> that unveils the daily life of <strong>app delivery workers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you play as Gil, a grumpy and persistent hedgehog struggling financially. In the delivery app, he finds a way to earn money to support his family, embarking on a journey filled with sweat, challenges, and unexpected twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing across the platforms</strong> with a mechanical arm, dare to make tough decisions, and <strong>lead a revolution in Morro do Mang\u00fat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/b0594dc18c3a010c6b06236a8ab16164.poster.avif?t=1755119086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/b0594dc18c3a010c6b06236a8ab16164.webm?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/b0594dc18c3a010c6b06236a8ab16164.mp4?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Narrative</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presents the dilemmas and challenges faced by a favela's worker;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explores themes such as entrepreneurship, meritocracy, and revolution;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features diverse and deep characters with contrasting worldviews;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Caramel&quot; mutt.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/5d87b42c75570e198ba81046b1d8ec56.poster.avif?t=1755119086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/5d87b42c75570e198ba81046b1d8ec56.webm?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/5d87b42c75570e198ba81046b1d8ec56.mp4?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Speed Precision Platformer</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, dash, and swing through the scenario with boldness and fun;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete deliveries as quickly as possible without damaging the cargo to satisfy your customers and optimize your earnings;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 20 levels with dozens of challenges, platforms, and secret areas for you to explore and showcase your skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/f63d10c06d6c9e39f97f78edf0e7bbc5.poster.avif?t=1755119086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/f63d10c06d6c9e39f97f78edf0e7bbc5.webm?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/f63d10c06d6c9e39f97f78edf0e7bbc5.mp4?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision-Making</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices in dialogues impact Gil's relationships with other characters and can affect gameplay;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter characters during levels: they may offer interesting side quests;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the money you earn strategically to pay the bills at the end of each day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/ed5e6c39fcd8e449cb8f01970320a0f6.poster.avif?t=1755119086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/ed5e6c39fcd8e449cb8f01970320a0f6.webm?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/ed5e6c39fcd8e449cb8f01970320a0f6.mp4?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Retrofuturistic Brazil</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gil has a mechanical arm prosthesis powered by energy, which can stretch and interact creatively with the environmental elements;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features characters, settings, and a soundtrack that are typically Brazilian, reimagined with steampunk and cyberpunk elements;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 unique scenarios: the favela Morro do Mang\u00fat, a forest in the city's upscale area, an open TV studio, and a drone factory with precarious working conditions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/b3d766e60fc2e457f821290cfab72485.poster.avif?t=1755119086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/b3d766e60fc2e457f821290cfab72485.webm?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/b3d766e60fc2e457f821290cfab72485.mp4?t=1755119086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
